msgstr "家族歷史上的 %(date)s ...\n"

msgid "... nothing happened!  Check again tomorrow!"
msgstr "... 什麼事也沒發生！明天再來看看！"

msgid "Report only living tree members"
msgstr "僅回報家族樹中仍在世的成員"

msgid "Show these events"
msgstr "顯示這些事件"

